Package: delphiPalettes
Title: Color Palettes Curated by 'delphi.tools'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Connor", "Brown", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ConnorBrown1996@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9680-8930")),
    person("Ruby Morgan", "Voigt", role = "dtc",
           comment = "Original palette designs ported from https://delphi.tools (GitHub: 1612elphi)"))
Description: A collection of color palettes for data visualisation, ported
    from the palette collection at 'delphi.tools' <https://delphi.tools>, a
    suite of privacy-respecting, browser-based design tools created by
    delphi <https://github.com/1612elphi/delphitools>. Palettes are
    organised into categories such as classic, nature, keycaps, vintage,
    modern, bold, soft, monochrome, seasonal, and artistic, and can be
    returned as discrete color vectors or interpolated to an arbitrary
    number of colors. Includes a function to identify which palettes
    remain distinguishable under simulated color vision deficiencies.
